}

###

DELETE {{ApiBaseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/locations/1
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

###

GET {{ApiBaseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/non-working-days
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

###

